        "Once the funds are released, issue the payment."
      ],
      "justification": "Chains successful match to fund release, uses a descriptive label for the transition, and executes the payment issuance."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n19"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Three-way match is successful, release the funds.",
